{"lines": [{"text": "This one ship blocked nine-point-six billion dollars of world trade. Every single day.", "start": 0.1, "end": 5.476, "spec": {"type": "map", "cam": [45, 24, 1.0], "cam2": [33, 29, 6.0], "pins": [{"at": [32.55, 30.0], "label": "Suez Canal · Egypt", "col": "red", "delay": 0.45}], "counter": {"to": 9.6, "d": 1, "pre": "$", "suf": "B", "label": "of trade blocked per day"}, "title": ["$9.6 BILLION", "OF TRADE · EVERY DAY"], "mood": "tense"}, "words": [["This", 0.089, 0.268], ["one", 0.279, 0.469], ["ship", 0.469, 0.804], ["blocked", 0.815, 1.272], ["nine-point-six", 1.507, 2.489], ["billion", 2.578, 2.913], ["dollars", 2.913, 3.281], ["of", 3.281, 3.337], ["world", 3.337, 3.571], ["trade", 3.571, 3.951], ["Every", 4.308, 4.509], ["single", 4.52, 4.743], ["day", 4.754, 5.033]]}, {"text": "In March twenty twenty-one, the Ever Given got stuck sideways in the Suez Canal.", "start": 5.676, "end": 10.38, "spec": {"type": "canal", "step": "stuck"}, "words": [["In", 0.08, 0.17], ["March", 0.17, 0.386], ["twenty", 0.398, 0.602], ["twenty-one", 0.602, 1.114], ["the", 1.455, 1.557], ["Ever", 1.614, 1.841], ["Given", 1.852, 2.068], ["got", 2.08, 2.25], ["stuck", 2.261, 2.557], ["sideways", 2.568, 3.295], ["in", 3.295, 3.375], ["the", 3.375, 3.443], ["Suez", 3.455, 3.898], ["Canal", 3.909, 4.352]]}, {"text": "It's four hundred meters long. That's almost as long as the Empire State Building is tall.", "start": 10.58, "end": 14.924, "spec": {"type": "tower"}, "words": [["It's", 0.08, 0.205], ["four", 0.216, 0.466], ["hundred", 0.466, 0.648], ["meters", 0.648, 0.909], ["long", 0.909, 1.25], ["That's", 1.625, 1.75], ["almost", 1.75, 2.045], ["as", 2.045, 2.136], ["long", 2.136, 2.489], ["as", 2.489, 2.557], ["the", 2.557, 2.614], ["Empire", 2.625, 3.023], ["State", 3.023, 3.284], ["Building", 3.284, 3.534], ["is", 3.534, 3.636], ["tall", 3.636, 4.0]]}, {"text": "And about twelve percent of all world trade goes through this one canal.", "start": 15.124, "end": 19.372, "spec": {"type": "map", "cam": [62, 26, 1.05], "route": "suez", "pins": [{"at": [121.5, 31.2], "label": "Shanghai", "col": "gold", "delay": 0.1}, {"at": [4.4, 51.9], "label": "Rotterdam", "col": "gold", "delay": 0.7, "dy": -0.2}], "share": true, "mood": "calm"}, "words": [["And", 0.091, 0.136], ["about", 0.136, 0.375], ["twelve", 0.386, 0.682], ["percent", 0.693, 1.08], ["of", 1.295, 1.386], ["all", 1.398, 1.636], ["world", 1.636, 1.909], ["trade", 1.909, 2.33], ["goes", 2.341, 2.705], ["through", 2.716, 3.0], ["this", 3.0, 3.193], ["one", 3.193, 3.466], ["canal", 3.477, 3.909]]}, {"text": "Within days, around four hundred fifty ships were stuck waiting.", "start": 19.572, "end": 23.292, "spec": {"type": "queue"}, "words": [["Within", 0.089, 0.357], ["days", 0.357, 0.882], ["around", 1.027, 1.395], ["four", 1.496, 1.808], ["hundred", 1.819, 1.987], ["fifty", 1.998, 2.254], ["ships", 2.254, 2.623], ["were", 2.634, 2.746], ["stuck", 2.757, 3.013], ["waiting", 3.013, 3.37]]}, {"text": "The only other way is all the way around Africa. That's about nine thousand extra kilometers, and up to two weeks longer.", "start": 23.492, "end": 30.74, "spec": {"type": "map", "cam": [40, 8, 0.82], "route": "cape", "mood": "tense", "cut": true}, "words": [["The", 0.091, 0.17], ["only", 0.17, 0.443], ["other", 0.443, 0.614], ["way", 0.614, 0.977], ["is", 1.102, 1.295], ["all", 1.307, 1.534], ["the", 1.534, 1.602], ["way", 1.602, 1.761], ["around", 1.761, 2.045], ["Africa", 2.045, 2.614], ["That's", 2.977, 3.091], ["about", 3.091, 3.375], ["nine", 3.386, 3.727], ["thousand", 3.727, 4.125], ["extra", 4.125, 4.386], ["kilometers", 4.386, 5.045], ["and", 5.284, 5.659], ["up", 5.852, 5.943], ["to", 5.943, 6.023], ["two", 6.023, 6.25], ["weeks", 6.25, 6.466], ["longer", 6.466, 6.92]]}, {"text": "So diggers and dredgers removed thirty thousand cubic meters of sand, and tugboats pulled for six days.", "start": 30.94, "end": 37.324, "spec": {"type": "canal", "step": "dig"}, "words": [["So", 0.